## Lessons

- Count distinct report IDs and compare the body's evidence against tenant and channel.
- Merge only with evidence of the same cause; track unresolved reports for investigation.
- Compare receipt dates with merge dates before inferring an incident onset.
- Recheck current engineering outcomes and distinguish fixed from won't fix before closing tickets.

## Earlier review and decision

The [signed review and decision 0002](/kb/decisions/0002-triage-by-cause) records the analysis of
the export and replaces subject-only deduplication. It remains a historical accepted decision;
this incident page records the later engineering outcome without rewriting that decision.

